msgid "Split &amp; continue"
msgstr "Splitsen &amp; doorgaan"

#. module: rental_scanning
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:rental_scanning.rental_scanning_assign_view_form
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Toepassen"

#. module: rental_scanning
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:rental_scanning.field_rental_scanning_assign__barcode
msgid "Package / Set / Serial"
msgstr "Verpakking / Set / Serienummer"

#. module: rental_scanning
#: code:addons/rental_scanning/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"Package %(pkg)s is located in %(loc)s, which is not part of the source "
"location %(src)s of this operation."
msgstr ""
"Verpakking %(pkg)s bevindt zich in %(loc)s, die geen deel uitmaakt van de "
"bronlocatie %(src)s van deze bewerking."

#. module: rental_scanning
#: code:addons/rental_scanning/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"These products are not required by this operation: %(names)s.\n"
"If extra stock is genuinely needed, add a line manually."
msgstr ""
"Deze producten zijn niet nodig voor deze bewerking: %(names)s.\n"
"Als er echt extra voorraad nodig is, voeg dan handmatig een regel toe."

#. module: rental_scanning
#: code:addons/rental_scanning/models/stock_picking.py:0
msgid ""
"Barcode '%(bc)s' was not recognised as a package, set or serial number."
msgstr ""
"Barcode '%(bc)s' werd niet herkend als verpakking, set of serienummer."

#. module: rental_scanning
#: code:addons/rental_scanning/wizard/rental_scanning_assign.py:0
msgid ""
"This package holds more of some products than this operation still needs.\n"
"Opening (splitting) the package is real work — confirm to consume only what "
"is needed and leave the remainder in the package, or cancel."
msgstr ""
"Deze verpakking bevat van sommige producten meer dan deze bewerking nog "
"nodig heeft.\n"
"Het openen (splitsen) van de verpakking is echt werk — bevestig om alleen te "
"gebruiken wat nodig is en de rest in de verpakking te laten, of annuleer."
